>geez! finally cleared out ft ludios, except for the room with the gold in it.
>how do i disarm the land mines? i'm considering casting create monster in there
>several times and letting monsters take all the hits..but is there a better way
>to do it?
Put on your ring of levitation and move several times over it. I don't
know if you have to have found the trap, but sometimes the landmine
is set off by the air-current. Together with a ring of searching,
this means that several times shift-L shift-H will be enough to clear
the whole line of mines.

One time, I got teleported into the treasure room: An energy vortex cought
me, and moved over the magic portal. (Is this a bug?) I had to fight my way
out of the fort. Luckily I had an athame and a ring of levitation, so
I could kill the monster room by room.  I had much troubles with Croesus, 
so I fled back to the treasure room. Croesus followed and was killed
by a land mine. :-)

Happy Hacking.

